msgstr ""
"Опциите за конфигуриране за [axis_twist_compensation] могат да бъдат "
"намерени в [Configuration Reference]"
"(Config_Reference.md#axis_twist_compensation)."

#: docs/Axis_Twist_Compensation.md:block 14 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Commands for [axis_twist_compensation] can be found in the [G-Codes "
